1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,250
Here's what every button on the Home page does.

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:07,923
Microphone mutes or unmutes your microphone in every app.

3
00:00:07,923 --> 00:00:13,360
The tile turns red and says Mic muted, and turns green again when you're live.

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:18,436
Volume minus and Volume plus change the volume by five percent,

5
00:00:18,436 --> 00:00:20,659
and Mute silences your speakers.

6
00:00:20,659 --> 00:00:23,160
Watch the slider at the bottom move.

7
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:30,680
Play Pause, Previous, and Next control whatever is playing, like YouTube Music or Spotify.

8
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:36,089
Screenshot saves a picture of all your screens to Pictures, Screenshots,

9
00:00:36,089 --> 00:00:38,116
and copies it to the clipboard.

10
00:00:38,116 --> 00:00:42,760
Snip opens the Windows snipping tool, so you can capture just one area.

11
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:48,546
App tiles, like YouTube Music, Discord, and Chrome, open those apps.

12
00:00:48,546 --> 00:00:52,360
A short message at the bottom confirms each action.

13
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:57,960
Task Manager, Explorer, and Settings open those Windows tools.

14
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:04,172
Focus lowers the volume, turns off notifications, and mutes the soundboard,

15
00:01:04,172 --> 00:01:05,862
so you can concentrate.

16
00:01:05,862 --> 00:01:08,140
Lock locks Windows immediately.

17
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:13,600
Important: Sleep, Restart, and Shut down affect your whole computer,

18
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:15,280
so save your work first.

19
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:18,150
PadDeck always asks you to confirm these,

20
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:22,350
and Restart and Shut down wait five seconds before starting.

